{"step_index":560,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:28:43Z","thinking":"**Consolidating verified lemmas**\n\nThe updater is currently processing. Examine `scratch.lean` to assess if placing the verified lemmas there would centralize their accessibility. Inspection of `scratch.lean` reveals existing imports and an open namespace.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Scratch file with verified helper lemmas for Challenge_e20263a9\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph\\nopen GraphCalc\\n\\nlemma minUpTo_le {n : ℕ} {p : ℕ → Prop} [DecidablePred p] (k : ℕ) (hk : k ≤ n) (hp : p k) :\\n    minUpTo n p ≤ k := by\\n  unfold minUpTo\\n  have hmem : k ∈ (Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p := by\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\\n    exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hk, hp⟩\\n  have hmin := Finset.min_le hmem\\n  generalize hmin_eq : ((Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p).min = m\\n  rw [hmin_eq] at hmin\\n  cases m with\\n  | top => contradiction\\n  | coe val =>\\n    simp only [WithTop.coe_le_coe] at hmin\\n    exact hmin\\n\\ntheorem radius_le_eccentricity {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) :\\n    GraphCalc.radius G ≤ GraphCalc.eccentricity G v := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.radius\\n  have hmem : GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ∈ Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ := by\\n    apply Finset.mem_image_of_mem\\n    exact Finset.mem_univ v\\n  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := Finset.min_of_mem hmem\\n  rw [hb]\\n  have hle : (Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ).min ≤ ↑(GraphCalc.eccentricity G v) :=\\n    Finset.min_le hmem\\n  rw [hb] at hle\\n  exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp hle\\n\\nlemma le_romanDominationNumber {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ)\\n    (h : ∀ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f → k ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f) :\\n    k ≤ GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber\\n  have h_ex : ∃ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f := by\\n    use (fun _ => 2)\\n    intro v hv\\n    dsimp at hv\\n    have h_false : False := by\\n      revert hv\\n      decide\\n    contradiction\\n  rcases h_ex with ⟨f₀, hf₀⟩\\n  have h_mem : GraphCalc.romanWeight f₀ ∈ (Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image GraphCalc.romanWeight := by\\n    rw [Finset.mem_image]\\n    exact ⟨f₀, \n<truncated 494 bytes>","Description":"\"Combine verified lemmas in scratch.lean\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/scratch.lean\"","toolAction":"\"Updating scratch.lean\"","toolSummary":"\"Write verified lemmas to scratch.lean\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
